      "tag": "Talk",
      "h2": "Putting It Together",
      "body_html": "<p>'J'ai un frere. Il s'appelle Tom' = 'I have a brother. He is called Tom'. Combine 'j'ai' with family vocab and names to describe everyone.</p>"
